 GameObject t\u1eeb Collider \u2192 Compare Tag PlayerArrow \u2192 If \u0111\u00fang tag \u2192 If health > 0. Ch\u1ec9 nh\u00e1nh True chuy\u1ec3n sang nh\u00f3m 10.","color":{"r":0.34,"g":0.13,"b":0.17,"a":1.0},"guid":"48bad1cc-19c4-42bb-b692-70769c4204f7","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GraphGroup"},{"position":{"xMin":0.0,"yMin":2180.0,"xMax":1500.0,"yMax":2780.0},"label":"08 | D\u1eeaNG TRONG L\u00daC HURT","comment":"Nh\u00e1nh isHurt=True t\u1eeb nh\u00f3m 04: v\u1eadn t\u1ed1c X=0, Animator isWalk=False. Ch\u1edd nh\u00f3m 11 \u0111\u1eb7t l\u1ea1i isHurt=False \u0111\u1ec3 ti\u1ebfp t\u1ee5c h\u00e0nh vi.","color":{"r":0.28,"g":0.12,"b":0.3,"a":1.0},"guid":"e0ac6954-e99c-4058-aa35-75ac507ad2a9","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GraphGroup"},{"position":{"xMin":3900.0,"yMin":2180.0,"xMax":6300.0,"yMax":3000.0},"label":"07 | G\u00c2Y S\u00c1T TH\u01af\u01a0NG V\u00c0 NGH\u1ec8","comment":"Timer ra \u0111\u00f2n Completed \u2192 ki\u1ec3m tra l\u1ea1i t\u1ea7m ngang. True: g\u1eedi PlayerTakeDamage \u0111\u1ebfn Player. False: \u0111\u00e1nh h\u1ee5t. C\u1ea3 hai \u0111i v\u00e0o Timer attackRecovery \u2192 isAttacking=False \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u00e1nh ti\u1ebfp.","color":{"r":0.36,"g":0.17,"b":0.08,"a":1.0},"guid":"5ff3500e-2715-49b0-840e-d0c764e79cff","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GraphGroup"},{"position":{"xMin":3900.0,"yMin":1100.0,"xMax":6300.0,"yMax":1980.0},"label":"06 | B\u1eaeT \u0110\u1ea6U \u0110\u00d2N \u0110\u00c1NH","comment":"Trong t\u1ea7m: d\u1eebng X, isWalk=False. If isAttacking=False \u2192 \u0111\u1eb7t True \u2192 Animator doAttack \u2192 Timer attackDelay. If isAttacking=True: kh\u00f4ng kh\u1edfi \u0111\u1ed9ng l\u1ea1i \u0111\u00f2n.","color":{"r":0.35,"g":0.24,"b":0.08,"a":1.0},"guid":"9c8d3446-a862-44ca-998d-4c87122408a9","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GraphGroup"},{"position":{"xMin":1700.0,"yMin":1100.0,"xMax":3700.0,"yMax":1980.0},"label":"05 | \u0110U\u1ed4I V\u00c0 QUAY M\u1eb6T","comment":"If deltaX > 0: v\u1eadn t\u1ed1c X = moveSpeed, Flip X=False, isWalk=True. Nh\u00e1nh c\u00f2n l\u1ea1i: v\u1eadn t\u1ed1c X = moveSpeed \u00d7 \u22121, Flip X=True, isWalk=True. Gi\u1eef nguy\u00ean v\u1eadn t\u1ed1c Y.","color":{"r":0.1,"g":0.31,"b":0.22,"a":1.0},"guid":"92cef296-bbd4-45c0-a17d-b7fbd7e3302e","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GraphGroup"},{"position":{"xMin":0.0,"yMin":1100.0,"xMax":1500.0,"yMax":1900.0},"label":"04 | CH\u1eccN H\u00c0NH VI","comment":"On Update \u2192 If isAwake \u2192 If isHurt. Hurt=True: nh\u00f3m 08. Hurt=False: ki\u1ec3m tra t\u1ea7m \u0111\u00e1nh; ngo\u00e0i t\u1ea7m \u2192 nh\u00f3m 05, trong t\u1ea7m \u2192 nh\u00f3m 06.","color":{"r":0.18,"g":0.25,"b":0.35,"a":1.0},"guid":"9c80d1b9-47ed-4896-955c-5f18f788e9d1","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GraphGroup"},{"position":{"xMin":3000.0,"yMin":0.0,"xMax":6300.0,"yMax":850.0},"label":"03 | H\u01af\u1edaNG V\u00c0 KHO\u1ea2NG C\u00c1CH","comment":"Data d\u00f9ng chung: deltaX = Player.position.x \u2212 This.position.x. deltaX > 0: Player b\u00ean ph\u1ea3i. Abs(deltaX) \u2264 attackRange: trong t\u1ea7m ngang. K\u1ebft qu\u1ea3 c\u1ea5p cho nh\u00f3m 04, 05 v\u00e0 07.","color":{"r":0.1,"g":0.23,"b":0.36,"a":1.0},"guid":"6925b5d7-f76e-4071-95cf-50c4176cde80","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GraphGroup"},{"position":{"xMin":6500,"yMin":0,"xMax":10100,"yMax":1200},"label":"02 | CAMERA PLAYER PH\u00c1T HI\u1ec6N","comment":"If isAwake=False \u2192 World To Viewport Point b\u1eb1ng Object MainCamera. Ki\u1ec3m tra 0<X<1, 0<Y<1, Z>0. C\u00f3 trong camera Player \u2192 isAwake=True r\u1ed3i \u0111u\u1ed5i/\u0111\u00e1nh; ch\u01b0a th\u1ea5y \u2192 v\u1eadn t\u1ed1c X=0, isWalk=False. Scene view kh\u00f4ng k\u00edch ho\u1ea1t. Sau khi th\u1ee9c th\u00ec ti\u1ebfp t\u1ee5c \u0111u\u1ed5i gi\u1ed1ng Skeleton. This ch\u1ec9 d\u00f9ng trong khung n\u00e0y.","color":{"r":0.1,"g":0.29,"b":0.31,"a":1.0},"guid":"c0a4